.TH NEO-LAUNCHER 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-launcher \- the Neo home screen of GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-launcher
.SH DESCRIPTION
Neo is a Wayland client drawn with Vulkan: home pages with a dock, the app drawer, widgets, icon packs and parallax wallpapers. It is started by the gnome-phone GNOME Shell extension, which makes its window the desktop, and is not meant to be run by hand. Its settings are the GSettings schema neo.Phone.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NEO_DENSITY
Device pixels per Android dp, instead of the compositor's scale.
.TP
.B NEO_WINDOWED
Run in a normal window rather than full screen (for development).
.SH SEE ALSO
gnome-shell(1)
